            <description><![CDATA[<h1>Codex Weekly Reset 0.1.2</h1>
<ul>
  <li>See your available banked resets and the next expiry beside the regular weekly reset.</li>
  <li>Get a clear one-day warning and a final one-hour alert before a banked reset expires.</li>
  <li>See accurate ring progress and consistent popover placement beneath the menu bar item.</li>
  <li>Receive future signed updates automatically, or check manually from the popover.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
